    "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#Number available: %d#LAST#\nProdigies are special talents that only the most powerful of characters can attain.%s\nAll of them require at least 50 in a core stat and many also have more special demands. You can learn a new prodigy at level 25 and 42.",
